  "paper_id": "ccs-2023-elektra-efficient-lightweight-multi-device-key-transpare-8d07fb06",
  "title": "ELEKTRA: Efficient Lightweight multi-dEvice Key TRAnsparency",
  "abstract": "Key Transparency (KT) systems enable service providers of end-to-end encrypted communication (E2EE) platforms to maintain a Verifiable Key Directory (VKD) that maps each user's identifier, such as a username or email address, to their identity public key(s). Users periodically monitor the directory to ensure their own identifier maps to the correct keys, thus detecting any attempt to register a fake key on their behalf to Meddler-in-the-Middle (MitM) their communications.",
